/-! Uniform (in the inserted-shell count `ns`) definitions of the refined-child native heat
step: the configured frames, initial moments, exponential, coefficients, fixed rows and the
48 passes, all built from the generic constructors of `Numerics/Native/Heat.lean` applied to
the gap `ns + 1` old row and individual cap.  The per-`ns` generated numerics files
`HeatNNN*.lean` agree with these definitions (see `HeatStepDataGen*`). -/

@[expose] public section

namespace ASDExplicitGamma.Native

open ASDExplicitGamma.Numerics.Native

